            "AlignX": 0,
            "AlignY": 0,
            "AlignRect": false,
            "Text": "quest status:\r\n0 - not initiated\r\n1 - 1st mission started\r\n2 - not used\r\n3 - 1st mission completed\r\n4 - 1st mission failed\r\n5 - 2nd mission started\r\n6 - 2nd mission failed\r\n7 - 2nd mission restarting\r\n8 - 2nd mission observe finished\r\n9 - 2nd mission investigation\r\n10 - 2nd mission completed\r\n11 - 3rd mission started\r\n12 - 3rd mission failed\r\n13 - 3rd mission destination found\r\n14 - 3rd mission completed",
            "Color": 16777215,
            "Font": "Arial",
